OL,3,ACanada to match Trump tariffs 'dollar
OL,4,Afor dollar' on $20bn worth of US goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanadian Prime Minister Mark Carney
OL,7,Faccused Trump of trying to "destroy"
OL,8,Fthe country's auto industry - their
OL,9,Frelationship has deteriorated
OL,10,Fsignificantly
OL,12,FThe US announced a 50% tariff on a
OL,13,Frange of Canadian goods after trade
OL,14,Ftalks collapsed at the weekend
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
