OL,3,ATornado tears through French village,
OL,4,Aleaving dozens hurt and homes ravaged
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Half the village has been destroyed,"
OL,7,Fsaid one resident called Pierre, who
OL,8,Fdescribed the tornado as swirling like
OL,9,Fa "huge red and yellow chimney".
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
